  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "地震相是沉积环境在地震剖面上的「长相」：平行连续多半是稳定席状沉积，前积斜交是三角洲推进，顶平底凸的透镜体是河道。解释员靠这些构型划相带，而相带图直接决定储层预测与井位。把这件事交给模型，难点不在图像分类本身，而在**标签只有井点那么几个**。",
      "judge": [
        {
          "label": "数据",
          "value": "振幅体 / 沿层切片",
          "desc": "单区块切片 1 万—10 万张，横向 25 m 网格"
        },
        {
          "label": "任务",
          "value": "逐像素 4—6 分类",
          "desc": "输出相带图 + 每类概率，边界要平滑"
        },
        {
          "label": "标签",
          "value": "井点标定 50—200 个",
          "desc": "井震标定把岩性/测井相映射到地震相"
        },
        {
          "label": "交付",
          "value": "相带图 + 不确定性",
          "desc": "熵高的地方交给解释员复核"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": "01",
          "en": "SEISMIC FACIES",
          "title": "四类反射构型，四种沉积环境",
          "html": "<p>地震相不是岩性，而是<b>反射结构</b>。同一套砂泥岩组合，沉积环境不同，剖面上的几何形态就不同：稳定海相是平行连续的，三角洲是前积斜交的，河道是顶平底凸的透镜体，滑塌是杂乱的。解释员先认构型，再套沉积模式，最后划相带。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 190\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四类地震反射构型\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"158\" height=\"128\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#f7f5ee\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"13.1111\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"13.1111\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"27.3333\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"27.3333\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"41.5556\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"41.5556\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"55.7778\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"55.7778\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"84.2222\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"84.2222\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"98.4444\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"98.4444\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"112.667\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"112.667\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"126.889\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"126.889\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.72\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".1em\">A</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">平行连续</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"1