y1=\"45\" x2=\"571\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"596\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"606\" y2=\"97\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"633\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"641\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"528\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"534\" y2=\"89\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"565\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"569\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"602\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"613\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"639\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"648\" y2=\"16\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"534\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"541\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"571\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"576\" y2=\"121\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"608\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"59\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"645\" y1=\"111\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"540\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"548\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"577\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"583\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"614\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"618\" y2=\"37\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"651\" y1=\"91\" x2=\"662\" y2=\"91\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"546\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"555\" y2=\"29\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"583\" y1=\"81\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"620\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"625\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"657\" y1=\"71\" x2=\"669\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"552\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"562\" y2=\"123\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"589\" y1=\"61\" x2=\"597\" y2=\"61\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"518\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".1em\">D</text><text x=\"518\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">杂乱</text><text x=\"518\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">滑塌 / 破碎带</text><text x=\"518\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">无固定相位，相干性差</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>四类最常见的反射构型。判断依据是连续性、几何形态与内部结构，而不是振幅绝对值。</span></div><p>这也是为什么「用振幅分类」通常不如「用小立方体分类」：单个像素没有构型，只有一小块三维邻域里才有。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "02",
          "en": "TWO ROUTES",
          "title": "两条技术路线：逐道，还是逐片",
          "html": "<p>工程上有两条主流路线。<b>逐道分类</b>把每道当成一条序列，输出一个相标签，优点是天然对应测井曲线、标签可直接用井点；<b>切片分类</b>把沿层切片当成一张图，逐像素分类，优点是保住横向连续性。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 196\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两条技术路线\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"320\" height=\"190\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">A · 逐道分类</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">把每一道当成一条序列</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"61.0098\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"69.0912\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"76.1693\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"83.0918\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"90.8493\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"99.6647\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"60\" height=\"58\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"124.4\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"128,80 124,82.2 124,77.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"62\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">1D CNN / GRU</text><line x1=\"214\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"234.4\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"238,80 234,82.2 234,77.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"62\" width=\"66\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"72\" width=\"66\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"82\" width=\"66\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#41699b\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"92\" width=\"66\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#8a8578\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">每道一个相标签</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#79828a\">优点：标签只需井点，天然与测井相对应</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#b05a51\">缺点：丢掉横向连续性，相带边界锯齿化</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">适用：井多、地层平缓、需要与测井相直接对比</text><rect x=\"340\" y=\"6\" width=\"334\" height=\"190\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">B · 切片 / 小立方体分类</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">沿层切片当成一张图，逐像素分类</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"48\" width=\"94\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"356\" y=\"58\" width=\"94\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\" opacity=\"0.65\"/><rect x=\"356\" y=\"68\" width=\"94\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\" opacity=\"0.7\"/><rect x=\"356\" y=\"78\" width=\"94\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\" opacity=\"0.75\"/><rect x=\"356\" y=\"88\" width=\"94\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#e8e4d8\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"362\" y=\"50\" width=\"44\" height=\"40\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"454\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"474.4\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"478,72 474,74.2 474,69.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"480\" y=\"54\" width=\"78\" height=\"36\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"492\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">2D U-Net</text><line x1=\"560\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"580.4\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"584,72 580,74.2 580,69.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"586\" y=\"54\" width=\"76\" height=\"36\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#f2efe6\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"588\" y=\"56\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"606\" y=\"56\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"624\" y=\"56\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#41699b\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"642\" y=\"56\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#8a8578\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"586\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">一张相带图</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#79828a\">优点：保住横向连续性，边界平滑</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#b05a51\">缺点：切片沿层位解释质量，标签要「一片一片」标</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">适用：构造复杂、相变快、有三维解释成果</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>两条路线的输入、模型与产物。实际项目常用「切片分类 + 逐道约束」的混合方案。</span></div><p>本案例的示范采用<b>切片思路的简化版</b>：沿一条剖面逐道分类，但把邻道的波形一起作为上下文，这样既能在浏览器里跑，又能演示边界效应。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "03",
          "en": "SPARSE LABELS",
          "title": "标签只有井点：弱监督与主动学习",
          "html": "<p>一个 100 km² 的区块，井可能只有 20 口，井点标定出的相标签覆盖率不到 1%。直接把这点标签喂给网络，模型会记住井的位置而不是相带规律。工程上的对策有三类：<b>弱监督</b>（用地质模式生成伪标签）、<b>半监督</b>（用高置信预测反哺训练）、<b>主动学习</b>（只标模型最不确定的地方）。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 182\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"稀疏标签与主动学习\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"300\" height=\"186\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f7f5ee\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"102\" height=\"186\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.2\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"6\" width=\"72\" height=\"186\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.2\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"6\" width=\"60\" height=\"186\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#41699b\" opacity=\"0.2\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"6\" width=\"66\" height=\"186\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8a8578\" opacity=\"0.2\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"26\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"26\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"81\" cy=\"69\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"81\" cy=\"69\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"112\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"112\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"203\" cy=\"155\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"203\" cy=\"155\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"52\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"52\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"53\" cy=\"95\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"53\" cy=\"95\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"114\" cy=\"138\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"114\" cy=\"138\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"35\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"35\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"78\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"236\" cy=\"78\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"121\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"121\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"86\" cy=\"164\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"86\" cy=\"164\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"147\" cy=\"61\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"147\" cy=\"61\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"208\" cy=\"104\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"208\" cy=\"104\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"269\" cy=\"147\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"269\" cy=\"147\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"44\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"119\" cy=\"87\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"119\" cy=\"87\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"130\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"130\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"241\" cy=\"27\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"241\" cy=\"27\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"70\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"70\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"113\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"113\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">井位 20 口</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#8e5229\" font-weight=\"600\">标注覆盖率 ≈ 0.3%</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">需要推断的区域 100%</text><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"96\" r=\"56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" opacity=\"0.9\"/><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"40\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#4d565b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练</text><circle cx=\"553.259\" cy=\"78.695\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"553.259\" y=\"69.695\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#4d565b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预测全库</text><circle cx=\"532.916\" cy=\"141.305\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"532.916\" y=\"132.305\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#4d565b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">挑不确定</text><circle cx=\"467.084\" cy=\"141.305\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"467.084\" y=\"132.305\" font-size=\"8.8\" fill=\"#4d565b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">人工标注</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#242b2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">主动学习</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">每轮只标 5%</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">同样标注预算下，主动学习通常比随机标注高 6—10 点准确率</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 3</b><span>左：井点标定相对于整个区块的覆盖率；右：主动学习的四步循环，每轮只增加 5% 标注量。</span></div><p>主动学习在这里特别有效，因为「模型不确定的地方」和「相带边界」高度重合——而相带边界正是人工解释最费时、也最影响后续井位的部分。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "04",
          "en": "EVALUATION",
          "title": "评价：准确率会骗人，边界才要命",
          "html": "<p>相带分类的总体准确率很容易做到 85% 以上，因为泥岩占了大半面积。真正决定成果可用性的是<b>相带边界的位置</b>：边界偏 3 个 CDP，砂体面积就可能差 15%。所以除了混淆矩阵，还要单独统计<b>边界带（真值边界 ±2 像素）内的准确率</b>。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 178\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"混淆矩阵与边界误差\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><text x=\"6\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".06em\">混淆矩阵（行=真实，列=预测，%）</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">席状砂</text><text x=\"156\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">河道砂</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">前积砂</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">泥岩</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"end\">席状砂</text><rect x=\"97\" y=\"27\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.817\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"49.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">86</text><rect x=\"137\" y=\"27\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.038\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"49.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">4</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"27\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.019\"/><text x=\"196\" y=\"49.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">2</text><rect x=\"217\" y=\"27\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.0095\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"49.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">1</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"end\">河道砂</text><rect x=\"97\" y=\"67\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.056999999999999995\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"89.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">6</text><rect x=\"137\" y=\"67\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.6745\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"89.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">71</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"67\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.076\"/><text x=\"196\" y=\"89.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">8</text><rect x=\"217\" y=\"67\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.028499999999999998\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"89.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">3</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"129\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"end\">前积砂</text><rect x=\"97\" y=\"107\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.028499999999999998\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">3</text><rect x=\"137\" y=\"107\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.08549999999999999\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">9</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"107\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.608\"/><text x=\"196\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">64</text><rect x=\"217\" y=\"107\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.056999999999999995\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"129.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">6</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"end\">泥岩</text><rect x=\"97\" y=\"147\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.0095\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"169.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">1</text><rect x=\"137\" y=\"147\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.019\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"169.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">2</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"147\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.0475\"/><text x=\"196\" y=\"169.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">5</text><rect x=\"217\" y=\"147\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.836\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"169.5\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">88</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".04em\">相带边界：错一条线，错一片面积</text><rect x=\"320\" y=\"26\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"26\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"106\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"106\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.22\"/><path d=\"M470 24 L470 24 L470 156 L470 156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M488 24 L488 24 L452 156 L452 156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"452\" y=\"26\" width=\"36\" height=\"118\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.1\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">真值边界</text><text x=\"512\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预测边界</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">容差带内</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">不算错</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 4</b><span>左：4 类混淆矩阵，非对角元素集中在相邻相带（河道↔前积），这正是地质上最难分的两类。右：边界偏移容差带。</span></div><p>还有一个容易被忽略的点：<b>类别定义本身是主观的</b>。同一区块两个解释员划出的相带数可能差一倍，所以验收时要先固定「相带方案」，再谈模型指标。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "从沿层切片到一张能用的相带图",
      "lead": [
        "流程的前两步（数据准备、井震标定）是工程里最耗时的部分，也是模型好坏的天花板；本案例的示范从**加噪后的剖面**开始，重点演示分类、混淆矩阵与单道不确定性。",
        "注意最后一步不是「输出相带图」，而是「输出相带图 + 不确定性」——后者才决定解释员先看哪里。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "区块",
          "160 km²，4 类相"
        ],
        [
          "切片",
          "沿 T2 层 ±8 ms，共 17 张"
        ],
        [
          "标签",
          "1 620 个井点"
        ],
        [
          "模型",
          "2D U-Net · 7.8 M"
        ]
      ],
      "figure": {
        "title": "五步数据流：标签从井点来，不确定性回到井点去",
        "lead": "注意第三步与第五步的输出都是「体」，不是「图」；相带图只是最大概率的切片显示。",
        "html": "<svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 182\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"相分类数据流\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"74\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"74\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">地震数据</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">振幅体 + 沿层切片</text><text x=\"77\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">2.1 GB</text><line x1=\"126\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"134.4\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"138,45 134,47.2 134,42.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"74\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"74\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">井震标定</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">20 口井 → 4 类相</text><text x=\"211\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">1 620 个标签点</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"268.4\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"272,45 268,47.2 268,42.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"274\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"74\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"274\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"74\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">切片分类</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">2D U-Net，4 类</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">0.31 准确率基线</text><line x1=\"394\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"402.4\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"406,45 402,47.2 402,42.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"408\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"74\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"408\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"74\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">概率体</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">每类一张概率图</text><text x=\"479\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">4 × 1.1 GB</text><line x1=\"528\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"536.4\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"540,45 536,47.2 536,42.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"542\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"74\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"542\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"74\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"554\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">相带图 + 不确定性</text><text x=\"554\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">最大概率 + 熵</text><text x=\"613\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">交付 1 套</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#79828a\">四个相带类别本身就是人为定义：同一区块两人划出的相带数可差一倍。</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#79828a\">所以评价要同时报「总体准确率」和「边界带准确率」，后者决定相带图能不能直接用。</text><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"674\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".08em\">本案例示范</text><rect x=\"78\" y=\"141\" width=\"123.62\" height=\"17\" rx=\"8.5\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"139.81\" y=\"152.74\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#235f51\" text-anchor=\"middle\">加噪 → 分类 → 混淆矩阵 → 单道概率</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">训练与井震标定用工程口径描述，不在浏览器里跑。</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">相带概率的熵 = 不确定性：熵高的位置正好是相带边界，也正是需要解释员复核的位置。</text></svg>",
        "caption": "四个相带类别由人定义，模型只负责把定义外推；不确定性（熵）标出外推最不可靠的位置。"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "沿层切片与归一化",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "沿 T2 层位上下各 8 ms 提取 17 张切片，做道均衡与分频增强；每张切片切成 128×128 的块，重叠 16 像素。",
          "effect": "得到 1.1 万个训练块，振幅动态范围统一，深部弱反射不被压制。",
          "trap": "直接用原始振幅切片。浅部强反射会主导损失函数，深部相带几乎学不到。"
        },
        {
          "name": "井震标定与标签映射",
          "role": "标签",
          "do": "用声波 + 密度做合成记录，把井点岩性/测井相标定到地震相位上，映射为 4 类地震相；对不整合面附近的穿时现象单独标注 ignore。",
          "effect": "1 620 个可靠标签点，另加 380 个「存疑」点不参与损失。",
          "trap": "把测井相直接当地震相。测井分辨率是分米级，地震是米级，二者不是一一对应。"
        },
        {
          "name": "切片分类训练",
          "role": "模型",
          "do": "2D U-Net，4 类 softmax，类别加权交叉熵 + dice；用井点标签监督，其余区域做一致性正则（半监督）。",
          "effect": "留出井准确率 0.81，边界带准确率 0.63。",
          "trap": "只报总体准确率。泥岩占 60% 面积，全预测泥岩也有 0.6。"
        },
        {
          "name": "相带图与不确定性",
          "role": "推断",
          "do": "对全区推理得到 4 张概率图，取最大概率为相带，计算归一化熵作为不确定性；熵 > 0.6 的区域自动进入复核清单。",
          "effect": "复核面积从 100% 降到 18%，其中包含 87% 的边界带错误。",
          "trap": "把 softmax 最大概率当成置信度。未校准的网络会过度自信，需要温度标定或深度集成。"
        },
        {
          "name": "人工复核与成图",
          "role": "交付",
          "do": "解释员按熵排序复核，修正边界后平滑成图；把修正结果回灌训练集，形成下一轮迭代。",
          "effect": "两轮后边界带准确率从 0.63 提到 0.72。",
          "trap": "修正完就结束，不回灌。同一个区块下一轮还会犯同样的边界错误。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "本案例的验收口径",
        "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0 2px;table-layout:fixed\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:6px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;background:#f5f2ea;text-align:left;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#9ba3a9;font-weight:500;width:24%;\">指标</th><th style=\"padding:6px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;background:#f5f2ea;text-align:left;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#9ba3a9;font-weight:500;width:30%;\">本案例取值</th><th style=\"padding:6px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;background:#f5f2ea;text-align:left;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#9ba3a9;font-weight:500;width:46%;\">用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">总体准确率</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">0.81</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">只作基线，不作为验收依据</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">边界带准确率</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">0.63 → 0.72（两轮复核）</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">验收主指标</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">相邻相带混淆</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">河道↔前积 8%</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">地质上本就难分，需人工兜底</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">复核面积</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">100% → 18%</td><td style=\"padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e4d8;color:#4d565b;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;font-size:11.5px;\">决定这套流程能不能落地</td></tr></tbody></table>"
      },
      "fails": [
        {
          "name": "相带数越跑越多",
          "why": "模型把噪声当成新相带，输出出现大量孤立小块。对策是后处理做最小面积过滤 + 众数滤波，并在标签阶段固定相带方案。"
        },
        {
          "name": "井位处过拟合",
          "why": "标签集中在 20 口井附近，模型学到「井附近是河道」而不是「河道长什么样」。对策是井位留一验证（leave-one-well-out），并做空间分块增强。"
        },
        {
          "name": "边界锯齿化",
          "why": "逐像素独立分类没有空间连续性约束。对策是加全变分/条件随机场后处理，或直接改用切片 + 大感受野模型。"
        }
      ]
    },
